v 0.0.4
d TestMechs (MVP): Stata translation of Jon Roth & Soonwoo Kwon's TestMechs R package.
d
d Installation:
d   net install testmechs, from("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chengchen2326/stata-testmechs/main") replace
d
d testmechs_test_sharpnull (Cox-Shi sharp null test) requires:
d   - Python 3 with packages: numpy, osqp (version 0.6.x)
d     (LP is now solved by the bundled GLPK plugin; only QP still uses Python.)
d   - Precompiled plugins ship for macOS Apple Silicon only.
d     Other platforms must rebuild from src/dqrdc2_src/ and src/glpk_lp_src/.
d
f src/testmechs_lb_fracaffected.ado
f src/testmechs_lb_fracaffected.sthlp
f src/testmechs_test_sharpnull.ado
f src/testmechs_test_sharpnull.sthlp
G MACARM64 src/_testmechs_dqrdc2_rank_macarm64.plugin _testmechs_dqrdc2_rank.plugin
G OSX.ARM64 src/_testmechs_dqrdc2_rank_macarm64.plugin _testmechs_dqrdc2_rank.plugin
G MACARM64 src/_testmechs_glpk_lp_macarm64.plugin _testmechs_glpk_lp.plugin
G OSX.ARM64 src/_testmechs_glpk_lp_macarm64.plugin _testmechs_glpk_lp.plugin
F _testmechs_qp_call.py
